      "title": "READ ME - quick start",
      "properties": {
        "text": ""
      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "AFLOY LORA BOX - example (Z-Image Turbo)\n=========================================\n1) Models: z_image_turbo_bf16 (UNet), qwen_3_4b (CLIP, type=lumina2),\n   ae.safetensors (VAE). From the Z-Image release.\n2) In the Lora Box node: click a row's 'Choose a LoRA...' to pick your\n   LoRA(s) - stack as many as you like, set the weight. Trigger words fill\n   in automatically. (Rows start empty - add your own.)\n3) Type your prompt in the Lora Box 'Prompt' field -> Queue.\n\nThe node outputs your prompt with the LoRA trigger words already merged,\nplus the patched MODEL/CLIP - one node loads the LoRAs AND wires the prompt.\n\nWorks with ANY architecture (SDXL/Flux/...) - this example is Z-Image Turbo;\nswap the loaders for your base. No third-party custom nodes required."
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    }
